      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAST PHANTOM (1) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish sixth (22.99) at this track over 390m. Has the inside box this time. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. SPRING HORSBURGH (4) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only half a length from the winner Moreton's Ten in second(19.95) at this track. Deserves a win and gets his chance. GOLDSTAR THEO (7) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at Casino over 300m behind Marlene Jenice (17.65). Likely to be about the mark. MOOSE (3) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
